---
import "./trail-description.css";
---

<section class="trail-description">

  <div class="container">

    <h2>The Trail</h2>

    <p>

      Via Trayana follows one of the historic mountain routes
      connecting the villages around Tryavna with the ridges of
      the Balkan Mountains. Forest paths, open meadows and
      panoramic viewpoints make this trail one of the most
      rewarding journeys in the region.

    </p>

    <p>

      Today the route is maintained by volunteers from TRAVNA
      together with local communities who share a common goal:
      to preserve mountain access while respecting nature,
      history and local traditions.

    </p>

  </div>

</section>